        "text_rDzYMf": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<h6>Each story begins with a single choice. At the core of every person is a quiet, innate desire to evolve, live better, and become more. We all share this fundamental aspiration. Good Era is the physical representation of that pursuit.</h6><h6>It’s not a phase; it’s the dawn of a new era. We aspire to support the evolution of you by clearing the obstacles between who you’ve been and who you are becoming—allowing you to reclaim your energy and sustain your momentum into your next chapter.  </h6><h6>Whether you are in the middle of a high-performance day or a slow Sunday reset, we are your partner for the transition. When you step into your Good Era, you aren’t just wearing a brand. You are joining a community of like-minded individuals stepping out of the shadows and into their Good Era.</h6>"
          }
        }
