            "text": "<h6>This brand speaks directly to those who are ready to embrace change, take risks, and carve out a new life for themselves—one that is aligned with their highest potential and truest self. You are not here because of who we are. You are here to become the person you want to become so you can live the life that you want to live.</h6><h6>When you step into  Good Era, you are investing in your own personal transformation.  It is the feeling of being in total alignment with your best self. </h6><h6>Welcome to your Good Era</h6>",
